12104/莫莉德尔skill2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312104/莫莉德尔born.mp4_20260811_162421.838.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312104/莫莉德尔unique.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312104/莫莉德尔born.mp4_20260811_162421.838.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312104/莫莉德尔born.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312104/莫莉德尔born.mp4_20260811_162421.838.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“当饱满的稻谷为烤面包镀金，葡萄会变成美酒再次醒来，玫瑰将举行盛大的游行……”  <br />收获之风已经越过山峦，欢庆的喧闹就在转角，在节庆的前夕让那些年纪较小的弟妹遵守纪律并非易事，但好在长姐以一个故事充分调动了“预备士兵”们对浣洗任务的积极性。重点关照袖口、保证军装衣领的笔挺、使用正确的手法以减少褶皱……她确保所有人手中的布料都能达到“军旗级别的洁净”。<br />终于，所有的“旗帜”都通过验收，乘着阳光与惠风，在孩子们的眼睫上投下一方安恬的倦意。<br />“……于是在这个特别的节日，每个表现优异的士兵都得到了一朵保加利亚玫瑰——嘉奖勤劳、智慧与生命的芬芳……” <br />阳光望向玫瑰午睡的心情，应与她此刻相同。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"312104\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-312107.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/29/Belonging-312107.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“耳畔的乡息”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Scent of Home\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一朵摘自萨尔亚尔卡晚星下的玫瑰，带着远方的芬芳，经不知名神秘术处理后不易枯萎。受访者将其与巴克西银饰搭配在一起，制成了这一枚典雅的耳坠。受访者透露，将其做成坠饰佩戴于耳畔是某位调香师向她推荐的一种用于安神的芳香疗法。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-312108.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/67/Belonging-312108.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“收获太阳”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Sun-Blessed\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />52<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一条黑底亚麻腰带，为搭配丰收节的礼服而准备。受访者表示，深色的腰带比浅色的衣物更能吸收光热，因此在晾晒衣物时，腰间会先传来暖意，仿佛儿时的送礼者们仍将她簇拥着。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-312109.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/00/Belonging-312109.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“小小的责任”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Her Cherished Duty\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一只小巧精致的绣金腰包。受访者曾展示过其中的物品——衣夹、针线与几枚纽扣。虽然她很擅长修复，但比起使用神秘术，她更倾向于使用温暖的双手，一针一线地把午后的阳光缝进弟弟妹妹们的衣角里，年年如此。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B61.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 玫瑰午睡时1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B61.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B61.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B61.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B61.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B61.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B61.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B62.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 玫瑰午睡时2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B62.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B62.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B62.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B62.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B62.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%AB%E7%91%B0%E5%8D%88%E7%9D%A1%E6%97%B62.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">玫瑰午睡时 <small style=\"color: grey\">Repose Amidst the Roses</small></span></span>"}}